 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "vo01",
   "beat": "open",
   "text": "The air can't keep up with the ground.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "01.wav",
   "dur": 2.192,
   "sha256": "db18645fe0acd2ffcd4bed8cfb39f98bb1a99bebbab05226a13aefbb20d5f577"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo02",
   "beat": "wind-1",
   "text": "But the air has a problem.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "02.wav",
   "dur": 1.829,
   "sha256": "745f88e55b93213b63755fe49a4dfa0f6ab6ff07087e38263a1f7155a3222c28"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo03",
   "beat": "wind-2",
   "text": "The ground speeds up at once; the atmosphere is pulled along only by friction, and that takes time.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "03.wav",
   "dur": 7.739,
   "sha256": "ae52b7ba8b9fe0748fcd4073053b548cc41f86a092b13c9ef988825d2ee332f1"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo04",
   "beat": "wind-3",
   "text": "For the first hours, the air is left behind.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "04.wav",
   "dur": 3.038,
   "sha256": "013f929f955393c1e2cdf36ec8a8c17e251602bf595d2e36f63b16a2c096c719"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo05",
   "beat": "wind-4",
   "text": "At a twelve hour day, the ground is moving through the air at about four hundred and sixty meters a second, faster than the speed of sound.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "05.wav",
   "dur": 10.381,
   "sha256": "d01af5421243f46a00247c99ce20013b1de8f1b039d565a5c5298cf9d2a91e49"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo06",
   "beat": "wind-5",
   "text": "That is about sixteen hundred and seventy kilometers an hour.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "06.wav",
   "dur": 4.756,
   "sha256": "e4a66cad632a91a33d267303df5c50c78d196d0765e880c296f620a529939595"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo07",
   "beat": "wind-6",
   "text": "The strongest gust ever measured by a weather station was about four hundred and eight kilometers an hour.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "07.wav",
   "dur": 8.157,
   "sha256": "54ad345b067e3de341f20cf71fea962a30b01ba4893107c08f516867f2347278"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo08",
   "beat": "wind-7",
   "text": "So this wind would be about four times stronger.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "08.wav",
   "dur": 3.379,
   "sha256": "e7c04eda472f75315a696c5c1a4a833ef9f672c0a227a020fea55ebea7047100"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo09",
   "beat": "wind-8",
   "text": "And it would blow from the east, because the ground is running ahead of the air.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "09.wav",
   "dur": 5.35,
   "sha256": "a0f5143c32156a23baca30a4abb4e90f7e94ad8e6526c703177027e8d5586c1d"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo10",
   "beat": "cta",
   "text": "Hang on. If you're enjoying this, tap like and follow. Okay, back to the math.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "10.wav",
   "dur": 6.197,
   "sha256": "1af20f4a97abdf86d2c8963174790231e18f3926e533514b83026de24df0b573"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo11",
   "beat": "wind-9",
   "text": "Winds like that would strip the surface, and they would only be the beginning.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "11.wav",
   "dur": 5.035,
   "sha256": "dad3ab9e571c4654729139cb3a82447c34acce10366557a76c7407f5b391b69d"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo12",
   "beat": "cliff",
   "text": "And then the oceans start to move.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "12.wav",
   "dur": 2.116,
   "sha256": "7f94d5648e44894aae69841c627f5a5c801eda50416f50b2d173d6dc67e59136"
  },
